## Crepe Batter {T-1h} ->&batter{}

/* Again, don't try this recipe at home ! */

[Mix] In a #bowl{}, mix the @*flour{250 g} with the @egg yolks{2}<@eggs{2} and the @eggs{1-2}. ->&mixture{}

[Whisk] In the @milk{200% @flour} into the &mixture{}. // Don't overmix !

[Add] Some @butter{30 g}(melted), the @vanilla extract{1 tsp}|@vanilla paste{1/2 tsp}, the @apple cider vinegar[vinegar]{}, a @-secret ingredient{1 pinch} and @?orange blossom water{1 tbsp}.

[Rest] Let it rest ~rest{1h}.

## Cooking

[Cook] The &batter{} in a #frying pan[pan]{=2}(25cm)|#griddle{} with some @&butter{10 g} over !{medium heat} for about ~{2min}&.²